WEBVTT

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.430
Stardust…

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:23.240
The overwhelming pressure from 
the two dragons is magnificent.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.320
Yusei, do you feel your soul trembling?

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:32.990
Against the King and his dragons, 
all you can do is be scared!

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.410
I swear I'll get it back!

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.870
My turn!

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:06.590
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:11.580
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:20.080
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:26.090
Break through even further

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:31.600
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:38.750
There's always only one truth

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.640
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:47.430
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:53.530
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:28.810
Clash of the Ace Dragons!  
Stardust vs Red Archfiend

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.240
I summon Shield Warrior in defense position!

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.960
Then I change Junk Warrior from 
attack position to defense position.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:43.880
Then I set one card.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.840
I end my turn.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:53.080
They're both in defense position?  
And you were so gung-ho just now.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.370
Stardust is waiting for you!

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.220
It's my turn!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.150
Let's battle!

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:25.860
Red Dragon Archfiend, attack Junk Warrior!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:30.720
Tremble before the crimson 
hammer!  Absolute Powerforce!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:39.550
Junk Warrior and Shield Warrior, I'm sorry.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.880
This is the attack of the King!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:46.580
Monsters that don't want to fight are 
useless on the King's battlefield.

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:48.770
The only thing they can do is be destroyed!

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:54.440
Due to Red Dragon Archfiend's monster effect,

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:58.740
all your monsters in defense 
position are destroyed!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.910
I can't believe it's this powerful…

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.990
There's more to the King's stage.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:08.070
I'll inflict pain that 
you've never felt before!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.140
Stardust Dragon.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:11.870
Stardust…

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.080
Attack him directly!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.410
This must be humiliating.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:35.610
You're losing life points to Stardust, 
a monster that used to belong to you!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.090
Master Atlas is impressive.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.590
He's controlling the two dragons skillfully.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.700
He's the King, after all.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:51.400
This fight will add to the history 
of the King's undefeated legend.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:58.330
It's your turn.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:02.670
Entertain the King with your antics!

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.760
My turn.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.740
I summon Sonic Chick in defense position!

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:17.190
Sonic Chick?  That's a mediocre monster.

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:23.330
Sonic Chick cannot be destroyed in battle 
against monsters with 1900 or more attack points.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.370
This is the appropriate 
monster in this situation.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.150
I set a card and end my turn.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.130
Bring it, Jack.  Bring 
it, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:47.920
The more you display your power, the more my 
cards shine when they combine their strengths!

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:51.270
I'm counting on you, Sonic Chick.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.390
My turn!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.710
Yusei!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:03.440
No matter what your strategies are, 
you're powerless against my strength!

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.360
Let's battle!

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:10.190
Red Dragon Archfiend, attack Sonic Chick!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:21.080
The monster effect that prevents it from being 
destroyed doesn't work against Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:28.430
With my monster effect, all your monsters 
in defense position are destroyed.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.930
Take this!

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.970
Demon Meteor!

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:38.350
What?  It wasn't destroyed?

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.340
So you used a trap.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:45.820
That's right!  This is a trap against 
your so-called absolute power.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.070
That trap is Remote Revenge.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:58.520
Remote Revenge can be activated when an effect 
that destroys a monster on my field is activated.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:04.930
It negates that effect, and all monsters in 
attack position on your field are destroyed!

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:08.540
Feel the power of your 
own Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:18.330
Another foolish choice!  That 
won't reach Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.250
Look at Stardust's monster effect!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.440
With Stardust Dragon's monster effect,

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:31.490
when an effect that destroys a card 
on the field is activated,

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:35.490
it can negate that effect 
by releasing this card.

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:38.190
I'm sure you knew that.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:48.310
What wonderful revenge.  You performed 
the last rites that released Stardust.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.610
My Red Dragon Archfiend isn't hurt at all!

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:58.040
Look, Yusei!  Look how beautifully 
Stardust Dragon wilts away!

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:09.450
I set two cards.

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:16.560
At the end of the turn, my monster's monster 
effect activates from the graveyard!

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.840
Resurrect, Stardust Dragon!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.980
It's Stardust Dragon's monster effect!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:35.220
If it released itself to activate 
its monster effect this turn,

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:41.370
can be summoned from the graveyard 
to the field at the the End Phase!

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.750
The second act begins!

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:48.680
Yes, the second act.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.900
I activate my trap card!

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:54.110
Harmonia Mirror!

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.260
I activate my trap card!

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.390
Harmonia Mirror!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.480
With Harmonia Mirror,

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:24.980
when a Synchro Monster is Special 
Summoned on to the opponent's field

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.780
in a method other than a Synchro Summon,

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:32.370
I can Special Summon that 
Synchro Monster on to my field!

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.710
I see.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.560
Of course you knew about that effect.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:45.630
That's how you used Stardust's 
effect to your own advantage.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.770
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:19.330
King!  The real second act begins!

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:23.930
Do you remember what you told me?

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:29.940
In a duel, you can't win 
if you only use monsters.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:33.790
You can't win if you only 
use traps or spells either.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:37.650
The true meaning appears 
when everything becomes one.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:45.650
And the most important thing you need 
to achieve victory is right here.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.560
You never told me what it was.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.860
However, I've found the answer!

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:56.310
I'll listen to your answer.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:11:00.750
It's the soul of a duelist 
that believes in all cards!

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:07.040
That soul called Stardust back to me.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:13.610
There's meaning in every monster and 
card that's destroyed and released.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.900
All of it was for this moment!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.340
Look, Jack.  This is how 
Stardust should appear!

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.430
Those two are facing each other?

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:33.050
I'm excited to see what will happen.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:50.970
Yusei, you're successfully 
fulfilling your pathetic role.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:57.670
Fine.  The King's excellent dueling 
will finish you in the second act!

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.370
Bring it!

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.560
My turn!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.780
I activate my Speed Spell - Silver Contrails!

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:24.350
One Wind Attribute monster on my 
field gains 1000 attack points.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:32.190
Stardust Dragon, attack Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:34.940
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:42.860
My arm aches…  What is this sensation?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.920
Your attack is negated!

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:05.150
Sonic Chick?

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.480
It's my trap card Synchro Deflector.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:13.830
The attack against a Synchro 
Monster on my field is deflected,

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:19.330
and the monster with the fewest attack 
points on your field is destroyed.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:23.500
How foolish can you get?

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:27.710
You caused your own destruction!

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:33.070
The effect of Silver Contrails has worn off.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:38.200
In that case, I summon Ghost Gardna 
from my hand in defense position!

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:42.730
So you're trying to protect Stardust.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.060
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:55.840
I apologize for what happened 
previously.  This is Akutsu.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:57.260
What do you want?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:03.130
Moment is currently gigantic!  
It's becoming out of control!

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.740
Record the entire situation.

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:09.020
As you wish.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:14.400
My turn.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:22.330
Let's have our dragons clash!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:30.690
Battle!  Red Dragon Archfiend, 
attack Stardust Dragon!

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:32.940
Absolute Powerforce!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.860
So you arrived, Ghost Gardna!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:42.330
Ghost Gardna's monster effect changes 
the target of attack to itself!

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:46.070
Ghost Gardna will be the one 
to battle Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.310
I knew that!

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:53.010
When Ghost Gardna is destroyed 
and sent to the graveyard,

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:57.010
it lowers the attack points of 
one of the opponent's monsters

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:59.010
by 1000 until the end of the turn.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:03.760
Now Stardust's attack points are 
greater than Red Dragon Archfiend's!

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:08.000
I activate a trap!  Counterattack Beacon!

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:12.930
Counterattack Beacon activates when a monster

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:17.840
on my field is destroyed due 
to your monster's attack!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:22.560
One of the monsters on my 
field gains 500 attack points,

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:26.550
and it is forced to battle against 
the monster that attacked.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:31.820
Interesting.  You also want 
to finish things right here!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:39.450
Battle!

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:44.470
I'm the one who will lower the curtains!

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.870
I activate the trap Prideful Roar!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:52.820
By paying 1000 life points, Red 
Dragon Archfiend's attack points

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:56.410
become 300 points more than 
Stardust Dragon's attack points!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:03.770
Oh my.  It's unlike the King to 
perform such a risky strategy.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:09.380
He gave up his own life points to 
give power to Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:12.350
Battle!

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:15.300
Take this!  Scorching Crimson Hellflare!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.000
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:46.730
What?  Why can't it destroy Stardust Dragon?

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:50.400
Red Dragon Archfiend has 
greater attack points!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:56.160
Shield Warrior?  But that 
was sent to the graveyard!

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:58.900
Its effect is meaningful 
when it's in the graveyard.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:01.930
By removing it from play from the graveyard,

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.930
it can negate the destruction 
of a monster due to battle once.

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:09.900
However, due to that attack, 
I still lose 300 life points.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.900
Prideful Roar's effect has also worn off.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.860
Red Dragon Archfiend is 
back to 2000 attack points.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:23.310
The King doesn't lose.  Speed Spell!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.810
Again?

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:30.490
What's this sensation?

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:34.920
This is...

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.270
What's happening?

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:58.850
What?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:27.020
It's incredible, Director.  
Something incredible is happening!

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.830
It has passed the critical point!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.270
What is that?

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:38.770
This is the final act!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:42.550
I activate a Speed Spell!  End of the Storm!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.550
I'm counting on you, Stardust!

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:49.880
And this will be the final act!

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:52.330
I activate my trap card!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.630
What's going on?

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.950
We switched to emergency power.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.100
The visuals aren't coming back.

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:09.700
What was that?

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.850
It's hot.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.070
What is this?

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:49.900
Moment's rotations are decreasing.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:55.150
The power in a two block radius 
around headquarters has stopped.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.960
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:00.580
Please hurry in restoring the city.

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:04.990
What about Master Atlas?

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.770
This is Neo Domino City Security.

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:27.570
Satellite citizens are not allowed into 
Neo Domino City without permission.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:31.020
By order of the Public Maintenance 
Department, you are under arrest.

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:09.570
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:14.960
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:20.890
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:26.130
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:29.290
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:34.880
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:42.040
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:47.440
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:53.380
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:58.720
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:04.810
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:14.230
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
